                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b1d47cc-3148-3e62-bffd-ff2213102ff6",
                        "entry_id": "c31bc3ef-4e00-3a0d-b0bd-e3c1dc5603db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полит. в ряде государств — должностное лицо, уполномоченное конституцией или специальным законом контролировать деятельность правительственных учреждений, министерств и ведомств; лицо, разбирающее жалобы частных лиц на различные организации"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8487f900-f712-4a82-8f33-d679512d9905",
                                "sense_id": "1b1d47cc-3148-3e62-bffd-ff2213102ff6",
                                "text": "Понятие «омбудсмен» ввели когда-то шведы — так называли посредника между властью и гражданами, защищающего права последних."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a376ac94-8cb8-32e3-9289-0f743108073e",
                        "entry_id": "c31bc3ef-4e00-3a0d-b0bd-e3c1dc5603db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. викип. участник википроекта, расследующий нарушение политики конфиденциальности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7495f4f5-289e-4132-8494-9b421ff8f59b",
                        "source_entry_id": "c31bc3ef-4e00-3a0d-b0bd-e3c1dc5603db",
                        "source_sense_description": "в государстве",
                        "target_lang_word": "ombudsman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ombudsman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "379e9dff-40b6-3166-84f4-dba4c96009ca",
                                        "entry_id": "dbbc894e-c278-3b1f-8a8e-36d0a41e6656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An appointed official whose duty is to investigate complaints, generally on behalf of individuals such as consumers or taxpayers, against institutions such as companies and government departments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53a0411d-3b31-409e-815c-b8801306ca6a",
                                                "sense_id": "379e9dff-40b6-3166-84f4-dba4c96009ca",
                                                "text": "\"All the Nordic ombudsmen have the same view: that circumcision of boys should not be done until the boy is old enough to decide himself if is something he wants to do,” Anne Lindboe, Norway's Ombudsman for Children, told DW."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "199e1dad-962a-4082-88f1-9a8b5db95c4e",
                                                "sense_id": "379e9dff-40b6-3166-84f4-dba4c96009ca",
                                                "text": "The ombudsman found that youth living at El Pueblo remained under the care and supervision of staff who had been accused of abusing them. In one case, a youth was reportedly dragged across the carpet by two staff members, resulting in rugburns on his face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f80aee13-96e3-3f7e-8aa2-c77ca66b42b7",
                                        "entry_id": "dbbc894e-c278-3b1f-8a8e-36d0a41e6656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A designated internal mediator in an organization whose duty is to assist members with conflict resolution and other problems and to serve as an independent consultant to recommend changes to policies or procedures to improve organization effectiveness, efficiency, and humaneness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0d30809-e052-4e53-b96f-702c8be6c45d",
                        "source_entry_id": "c31bc3ef-4e00-3a0d-b0bd-e3c1dc5603db",
                        "source_sense_description": "в государстве",
                        "target_lang_word": "Ombudsmann",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Ombudsmann",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ed4cf62-50ed-3f72-9ae2-1907ba1a0deb",
                                        "entry_id": "769ec601-f33f-336b-a7d1-09be09cda6fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "männlicher Vertreter eines Personenkreises in nichtgerichtlichen Streitfällen gegenüber einer Organisation, Firma oder Institution"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49f8b5fb-5433-4a44-a855-5fd827bbc51f",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4cf62-50ed-3f72-9ae2-1907ba1a0deb",
                                                "text": "Der Ombudsmann der Versicherung konnte den Streitfall zur Zufriedenheit des Kunden lösen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "613f341a-b23b-424a-af29-32b888d5c98e",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4cf62-50ed-3f72-9ae2-1907ba1a0deb",
                                                "text": "„Der Bonner Juraprofessor Wolfgang Löwer, Sprecher des »Ombudsmanns« der Deutschen Forschungsgemeinschaft, war nach seinen Angaben bereits an vier oder fünf Verfahren beteiligt, an deren Ende die Doktoren keinen Titel mehr hatten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e558c12d-aef1-42d6-9d77-97efd44edd2f",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4cf62-50ed-3f72-9ae2-1907ba1a0deb",
                                                "text": "„Sogar Subari war als Ombudsmann bis 2009 oberster Menschenrechtler im Land.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
